{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10642020","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10642020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1064202001:1":{"text":"젠장, 또 이 꿈인가...","source_cn":"该死的……又是这个梦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBF1879952F12207","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064202002:1":{"text":"끝없이 반복되는 악몽... 아인은 이미 너무나도 익숙한 악몽에서 당장 깨어나기를 기도했다.","source_cn":"周而复始的噩梦……埃因再熟悉不过。他祈祷着自己能马上清醒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE341152642B969C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064202003:1":{"text":"머지않아 마이카가 또 꿈속에 나타나 아인을 부를 것이다. 그리고 마물이 미친 듯이 웃는 소리가 들려올 차례인데...","source_cn":"要不了多久，迈克尔又会在梦中出现，摇晃他，呼唤他，直到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB28D45366C9F7D55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064202004:0":{"text":"오빠... 오빠...","source_cn":"大哥哥……大哥哥……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42A7AF87F7928FFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064202005:0":{"text":"왜 여기 누워 있어요?","source_cn":"你怎么躺在这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5CE402E9D61A845","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064202006:1":{"text":"거기 누구야?!","source_cn":"谁？！<key:dialog106>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C467C04CB9C8CAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064202007:1":{"text":"아인이 번쩍 눈을 떴다. 싸늘한 달빛 아래, 웬 어린 소녀가 허리를 숙인 채 그를 가만히 내려다보고 있었다.","source_cn":"埃因猛地撑开眼睛。清冷的月光下，有个小女孩正站在一旁，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x518B6716EB284608","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064202008:1":{"text":"소녀는 품에 특이하게 생긴... 유니콘 인형 하나를 안고 있었다.","source_cn":"小女孩怀着还抱着一只造型奇特的……独角兽玩偶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF161A4A01DF41B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064202009:0":{"text":"미안해요... 제가 방해했나요?","source_cn":"对不起……我吓到你了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x407FEEA33F41A4DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1064202010:1":{"text":"...아니.","source_cn":"……没有。<key:dialog106>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB37902081C3C2CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064202011:1":{"text":"포격 소리가 들리는데... 꼬마야, 왜 혼자 있어? 여긴 위험해.","source_cn":"能听到炮火声……小姑娘，你为什么一个人待在这里？这里很危险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD0B9482FEDDBFA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064202012:1":{"text":"응... 알아요.","source_cn":"嗯……我知道。<key:dialog106>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F3AD36DD10BB115","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064202013:1":{"text":"멀리서 싸움이 일어나서, 마... 음... 그 무서운 괴물들이 언제든지 마을로 쳐들어올 수 있잖아요.","source_cn":"远处在打仗，魔……唔，那些可怕的怪物，随时可能入侵村子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF51B5F9629C07BF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064202014:1":{"text":"하지만 오빠도 여기 있잖아요?","source_cn":"可是，大哥哥，你不是也没走吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C2B7C83C5A63ECF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064202015:1":{"text":"도망칠 수 있는 사람들은 다 떠났어요. 오빠는 왜 아직도 여기 있는 거예요?","source_cn":"能逃跑的人，都离开了。你不和他们一起吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DBA730FE4063E7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1064202016:1":{"text":"도망? 아니... 난 도망 못 가.","source_cn":"逃跑？不，不对……我不能跑……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75577CBFFA0FCC2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064202017:1":{"text":"왜요?","source_cn":"为什么？<key:dialog106>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7453A98B439BD3DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064202018:1":{"text":"모두와 함께 세상을 해치는 마물을 죽여야 하니까!","source_cn":"我得和大家一起，杀了那些祸害世间的魔物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C8363F290825EAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064202019:1":{"text":"마물을... 죽여요...?\n그런 일은 원래 병사나 마법사가 하는 거 아닌가요?","source_cn":"杀魔物……？\\n这种事，不是应该交给士兵，和魔法师吗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F5C1EE117F35DD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064202020:1":{"text":"딱 보면 모르겠어? 나도 병사야!","source_cn":"你看不出来吗？我就是士兵啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF661C10357B3F31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064202021:1":{"text":"음, 병사의 옷을 입고 있긴 하네요...","source_cn":"唔，你的确穿着士兵的衣服……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD05101ABCC2E8906","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064202022:1":{"text":"하지만 이 마을은 전선에서 아주 멀잖아요... 왜 여기서 자고 있었던 건가요?","source_cn":"可是，这座村子离前线很远……你为什么会在这里睡觉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8DEE268D4703C2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1064202023:1":{"text":"그런 눈으로 보지 마. 나도 왜 내가 여기 있는지 모르겠으니까...","source_cn":"别用那种眼神看我，我也不知道自己为什么会出现在这里……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC345B389C60C49CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064202024:1":{"text":"오호? 설마 탈영병인가?","source_cn":"噢吼？莫非说，你是逃兵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD95DEE8E05C89A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064202025:1":{"text":"...누구야?!","source_cn":"……谁？！谁在说话？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8CD2764EEF0236E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1064202026:1":{"text":"누, 누가 있나요? 전 못 들었는데...","source_cn":"有、有人说话吗？我没听到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70AAECE1582B2350","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1064202027:0":{"text":"오빠, 너무 긴장했어요. 나무 위의 새소리를 잘못 들은 거 아니에요?","source_cn":"大哥哥，你太紧张了……是不是把树梢上的鸟鸣听错了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x805377548B33AE3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064202028:0":{"text":"여기 새가 몇 마리나 있겠어? 어쨌든 나는...","source_cn":"这地方哪还有几只鸟？总之，我——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BDB52A7E09636CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064202029:1":{"text":"...쾅!","source_cn":"——砰！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB67C58F9D43C40EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064202030:0":{"text":"거대한 폭발음과 함께 눈부신 붉은빛이 하늘 끝에서 치솟았다. 천둥 같은 소리에, 아인은 자신도 모르게 몸을 움츠리고 떨기 시작했다.","source_cn":"伴随着巨大的爆炸声，刺目的火红从天边飞起。如同惊雷的声...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1140E2E847C22EB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1064202031:0":{"text":"어두운 밤과 끔찍한 습격. 그건 전쟁터에 대한 마지막 기억이었다. 그때 아인이 구하지 못한 마이카는 다른 전우들과 함께 어둠 속으로 떨어져, 다시는 아침 햇살을 마주할 수 없었다…","source_cn":"同样昏沉的夜晚和可怖的袭击，构成了他对于战场的最后记忆...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE160F4DC9585322","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064202032:0":{"text":"오빠... 괜찮아요. 무서워하지 말아요...","source_cn":"大哥哥……没事的，别害怕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D2D003E3C066BA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064202033:0":{"text":"무, 무서운 게 아니야... <shk>난 탈영병이 아니라고!</shk>","source_cn":"我、我没有害怕……<shk>我不是逃兵！！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x894FF45195E94EA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064202034:0":{"text":"알아요... 오빠는 탈영병이 아니에요. 마지막 순간까지 싸웠잖아요.","source_cn":"我知道……你不是逃兵，你战斗到了最后一刻。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD436DB11FE34BE68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1064202035:0":{"text":"다들 알아요... 듀라 여신님도 알고 계세요.","source_cn":"大家都知道……艾雅女神，也知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99C3BA298CE953C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064202036:0":{"text":"아인은 멍하니 소녀를 바라보았다. 순간, 소녀의 모습이 듀라 여신의 조각상과 겹쳐 보였다.","source_cn":"埃因恍惚地望着她，有那么一瞬间，她的身影竟与艾雅女神的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAB06E336D5A11ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064202037:0":{"text":"하지만... 전쟁은 아직 끝나지 않았잖아. 마지막 순간이 아직 오지 않았어... 모두를 도우러 돌아가야 해!","source_cn":"但是……但是战争还没有结束，最后一刻还没有来临……我得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B65F465E282917E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064202038:0":{"text":"아니다, 널 여기에 혼자 둘 수는 없어. 전쟁의 불길은 빠르게 번질 거야. 널 먼저 안전한 곳으로 데려다줘야겠어.","source_cn":"……不，不行。不能把你独自留在这里。战火蔓延的速度很快...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8500A805ECF8E9D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1064202039:1":{"text":"저를요? 정말요?","source_cn":"带我走？真的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3765A89BF6BF306","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064202040:1":{"text":"저는 힘도 약하고 체력도 안 좋아서 오빠의 걸음을 따라갈 수 없어요... 만약 마물을 만나면 짐이 될 텐데요.","source_cn":"我的力气很小，体力很差，跟不上你的步子……万一遇到魔物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1B0320DA57E7580","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064202041:0":{"text":"어쩌면 오빠가 죽을 수도 있어요... 아니, 죽는 것보다 더 끔찍한 일을 겪을 수도 있고요.","source_cn":"说不定，你会被我害死……或者是，比死更惨……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AB8BBBE257333BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1064202042:0":{"text":"그래도 저를 데려가 줄 건가요?","source_cn":"即便这样，你也要带着我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x596A9CE64AE8F8FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064202043:0":{"text":"... ","source_cn":"…………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70646B5D874C111A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064202044:0":{"text":"쓸데없는 소리 하지 말고 얼른 내 뒤에 붙어.","source_cn":"少说傻话，跟紧我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C3A52B44DE8BD76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1064202045:0":{"text":"심연으로 떨어진다 해도, 내가 지켜줄게.","source_cn":"哪怕坠入深渊，我也会保护你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BD872864248CE2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064202046:0":{"text":"원정대의 일원으로서... 난 모두를 지키겠다고 맹세했으니까.","source_cn":"身为远征军的一员……我发过誓，要保护所有人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0B7FBF084084A38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064202047:0":{"text":"네, 믿을게요.\n아인 오빠.","source_cn":"嗯，我相信你。\\n埃因哥哥。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6840815A9AD1C7C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064202048:0":{"text":"내... 내 이름을 어떻게 알아?","source_cn":"你……你怎么知道我的名字？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x397CB1EFB7696F48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1064202049:0":{"text":"어... 오빠가 말했잖아요.","source_cn":"啊……是你自己说的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9D01518BF015576","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1064202050:0":{"text":"내가?","source_cn":"我？我说过吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1EE2804E2ACF540","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1064202051:0":{"text":"그, 그럼요... 여기 다른 사람도 없는걸요.","source_cn":"当、当然……这里没有其他人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38EB50C2EA7547E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:63:1064202052:0":{"text":"오빠가 말해 주지 않았다면, 제가 어떻게 알았겠어요?","source_cn":"如果不是你告诉我，我怎么可能知道呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF68F686329FB107","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1064202053:0":{"text":"음... 내가 말했었나...","source_cn":"呃，也许真是我忘了自己说过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82B0906C35BA8E7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:65:1064202054:0":{"text":"아, 네 이름은 뭐니? 아직 이름도 안 물어봤네.","source_cn":"对了，你叫什么？我还不知道你的名字。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9AA9A2323561E65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1064202055:0":{"text":"저는... 아로라예요.","source_cn":"我叫……奥萝菈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B4D55C25A4019D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:埃因":{"text":"아인","source":"埃因","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小女孩的声音":{"text":"소녀의 목소리","source":"小女孩的声音","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:抱玩偶的女孩":{"text":"인형을 안은 소녀","source":"抱玩偶的女孩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雄厚的声音":{"text":"중후한 목소리","source":"雄厚的声音","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:巨大的声音":{"text":"커다란 목소리","source":"巨大的声音","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":56,"localized_text_count":55,"speaker_count":6}}